      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kooskia%2C_Idaho"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Kooskia was originally called Stuart, honoring Nez Perce surveyor James Stuart, before adopting its current name in 1909.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
